Documented Exceptions & Fairness Limits
• Product Type Variance: Crazy Dog sells pre-printed novelty ringspun graphic tees ($14.99 on sale from $18.99 in Heather Navy, Size S), whereas CheapesTees sells blank wholesale Gildan 3000 Light Cotton tees ($2.98 in White, Size M) and Jiffy sells blank Comfort Colors C1717 Heavyweight tees ($6.28 White / $7.53 Butter) alongside custom-printed C1717 shirts ($38.38 for 1 custom 'Store Sign' shirt).
• Cart Add-On & Shipping Variance: CheapesTees automatically includes a $0.49 Shipping Protection fee in the cart ($3.47 subtotal), while Jiffy's cart screenshot reflects a custom-printed C1717 tee ($38.38) with optional Saturday Fast Delivery (+$9.95, totaling $48.33) alongside a $0.00 Standard Delivery option.

